Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 19:47:29 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1096/1177] The Refiner's progress up top and each step's yield
 (1129); the page from disk, no gzip in the loop (1130); the score in the
 datasheet, a Direct take's from its sound (1131); the Refiner's own column
 and F5 (1132)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
